3. Escalate a systemic or severe-novel exposure	CRO, executive risk committee	Lane 1 pattern with material exposure-adjusted loss or harm across business units, or Lane 2 severe pattern with a structurally similar configuration elsewhere, expert-reviewed.	Committee funds a change, assigns a role-level owner or records explicit risk acceptance.	Changes funded, acceptances recorded, exposure-adjusted trend against comparison.
